{"title":"Algebra/Advanced","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>An advanced study of algebra (beyond that of contest math) involves the following topics;\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebraic_geometry\" title=\"Algebraic geometry\">Algebraic geometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Field_theory\" title=\"Field theory\">Field theory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Galois_theory\" title=\"Galois theory\">Galois theory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Group_theory\" title=\"Group theory\">Group theory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Homological_algebra&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Homological algebra (page does not exist)\">Homological algebra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Lie_theory&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Lie theory (page does not exist)\">Lie theory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ring_theory\" title=\"Ring theory\">Ring theory</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Advanced&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Introduction\" title=\"Algebra/Introduction\"> Introductory Algebra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Intermediate\" title=\"Algebra/Intermediate\"> Intermediate Algebra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Olympiad\" title=\"Algebra/Olympiad\"> Olympiad Algebra</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017212322\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 